# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Rules here win over static files with the same path.
#
# Legacy /notes/* URLs moved to /artifacts/* in the 2026-04 rename. astro.config.mjs
# also emits meta-refresh pages for them (used by `astro dev`/`astro preview`), but
# on Cloudflare these rules answer first with a real 301, which is what search
# engines need to transfer the old URLs.
/notes          /artifacts/     301
/notes/         /artifacts/     301
/en/notes       /en/artifacts/  301
/en/notes/      /en/artifacts/  301
/notes/*        /artifacts/:splat     301
/en/notes/*     /en/artifacts/:splat  301
